WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:03.260
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:03.260
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:09.200
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:09.200
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:19.770
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.710
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:23.730
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:23.730
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:27.170
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:27.170
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:30.940
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:30.940
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.220
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.220
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:38.660
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:38.660
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:45.250
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:45.250
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:49.710
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:49.710
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.780
I can say love

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:53.510
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:53.510
It overflows with love.

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:53.510
will you love me?

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:57.120
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:57.120
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:00.070
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:00.070
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:03.630
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:03.630
The shape of your love,

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:08.280
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:08.280
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:37.320
Morning begins with breakfast.

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:38.900
Seina-chan?

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:41.740
Seina's Room

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.290
Seina-chan! Seina-chan!

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:47.730
It looks like he's really
exhausted from yesterday...

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:48.790
I guess...

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:51.750
I'll have to wake him up...

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.170
Seina-chan, it's morning!

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:20.570
Gimme five more minutes, Mom.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.540
Come on, Seina-kun, get up!

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:29.250
Get up!

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:35.760
No...

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:37.760
No!

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:39.470
No!

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.970
No! No! No!

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:45.180
G-Good morning!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.980
No!

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:51.230
Meet the Parents

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.730
Yummy!

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.360
Elma, that's not for you!

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:42.940
Even though I purposely let
you two eat by yourselves,

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:44.570
you still haven't made up yet?

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:46.990
Who said we're fighting?

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:48.830
That's not what I meant...

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:50.330
Here you are, Seina-chan!

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:52.660
E-Elma-san...

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.480
Um...

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:00.710
I thought you would be playing
newlywed couple like this, but...

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.490
Will you just forget about it!

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:04.370
I can't clean up if we don't hurry and eat!

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:05.370
Morning!

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.670
A-Amane!

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:10.350
What do you think you're
doing dressed like that?!

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.310
How are you feeling, Seina?

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:14.790
Do your muscles hurt at all?

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.020
J-Just a little...

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:17.360
Don't you ignore me, Amane!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.820
Aren't you glad I gave you
that massage last night?

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.490
You might not have been able
to get up today if I hadn't...

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.860
What's that?

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:23.860
T-That's...!

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:29.360
Are you still mad about
yesterday, Seina-chan?

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:30.080
No, uh...

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.370
Amane, knock that off this instant!

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:32.500
Knock what off?

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.080
At least cover up your front!

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.880
I think that look might be even more...

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.360
I see...

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.890
So this look is better...

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:52.890
Open wide, Seina. It tastes good.

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:54.600
Amane!

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.610
W-What...?!

00:04:58.610 --> 00:04:59.610
Seina's Private Bathroom

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:01.560
Oh, man...

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:04.610
First Kiriko-san, then Amane-sensei...

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:15.040
Yo!

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:18.880
Oh, my...

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:23.020
Seina-chan, would you like some coffee?

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:24.880
Oh, what a surprise.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:27.380
Seina, coming out of nowhere like that...

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:31.070
To think that he would open the
bathroom door to peep on me like that...

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:32.850
What a surprise that was!

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:35.600
So embarrassing!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.100
N-N-No way!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.970
Seina-chan would do something like that?!

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:43.650
But didn't we make that
Seina's private bathroom?

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:44.420
Which means...

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:45.820
Amane!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.380
The fun just never stops.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:50.070
Hot!

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:57.770
Leave Seina to me and hurry off to work already!

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:58.790
We'll be just fine, right?

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:03.210
I'll try my best...

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.520
The word hurry gives me a bad feeling...

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:09.500
It's alright, I put a
surveillance camera on the NB,

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:11.470
so we can tell if something
happened when we get back.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:14.130
Can't we watch for ourselves somehow?

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:16.790
The level of security in this
house is tremendously high, so...

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.760
You're going to be late if you don't hurry!

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:19.980
We'll see you later.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:26.490
Okay, now with those two obstacles
outta the way we can have some fun!

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.600
I mean... We can get to your special training!

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:33.240
Okay...

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.400
Um, Amane-sensei...

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:37.250
What's this...?

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:39.940
Just what it looks like: cleaning.

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:43.710
I told you before that daily
activities are the best training for you.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:44.710
Got it?

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:45.930
Yes...

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:46.890
Now then...

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:48.720
What are you going to do with NB?

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.260
It looks like someone's been messing with it,

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.520
plus I thought I'd also customize it a bit.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.470
Hey, stop staring and get cleaning!

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:02.470
There we go...

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:06.690
I'll install a bunch of interesting
software for you, you'll love it!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.570
Okay! Please do...

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.840
Looks like you still don't have
a grasp on how strong you are...

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:19.200
I'll keep trying my best...

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.210
I see...

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.230
Seina-kun, Seina-kun...

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:25.880
Yes?

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:29.880
Oh, nothing...

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:34.170
Seina-kun!

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:36.890
Seina-kun~

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.930
Oh, nothing~

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:42.900
Oh, so good~

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:49.900
I-I had a nosebleed...

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.220
It looks like you still need a lot of training...

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:53.820
Training for what?

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:57.100
Maybe I installed too much software...

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.330
Is it broken?!

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:02.330
Yeah, this stupid piece of junk!

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.080
Stop it, please! You're really going to break it!

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:11.760
You okay?

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.970
I-I'll keep trying my best...

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.470
I'm so jealous of that Seina!

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:18.590
Living in Amane-san's house,

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:20.660
surrounded by beautiful ladies...

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.480
Everyday must be a blast for him...

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:25.480
But the pain from undergoing
body enhancement is excruciating.

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.730
I don't think he could do anything
with muscular pain like that...

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:28.730
Good morning!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:31.690
Come on, this is Amane-san's personal
instruction we're talking about!

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:32.740
This very minute,

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.670
Seina could be getting intimately acquainted with her.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:33.930
Good morning!

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:38.450
It's so obvious that the two are getting it on!

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:40.940
It's entirely possible!

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:45.920
Just now, Kiriko-sensei...

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:47.900
...gone.

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:50.920
This feels great!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.250
Hurry up and clean, would you?

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.470
I wanna get into that bath next.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:57.680
U-Underst...

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:03.070
When you're done there, why don't you come join me?

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:04.010
I'll give you another massage...

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.350
I-I don't need one right now!

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:09.860
Hey now! When talking to someone
you're supposed to look at them!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.030
Now you're definitely toying with me!

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:15.860
I'll get it!

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.370
He got away.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.240
Ah, it's good to see you again, Seina-kun.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:22.120
How's the training going?

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.550
I was worried so I came to check up on you!

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:26.000
Wait, Tennan-sensei!

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:29.710
Hey there.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:30.990
What is this thing?

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.850
The name's NB.

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:32.240
Where's Amane?

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:33.840
She's taking a bath.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:34.720
What? A bath?!

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.720
She's been in there for quite a long time...

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.930
What?! If she's fainted in the tub, then...

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:40.970
What do you say we go and check?

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:43.720
S-Sensei!

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:44.730
Amane!

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:46.940
Amane!

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.600
Where're you hiding?!

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:49.920
And what will you do if you find me?

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:53.480
Give you a heart massage and mouth-to-mouth!

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.360
Oh?

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:58.120
N-No, Amane...

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:59.570
She's all yours, buddy.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.580
I-I'm so glad you're all right, Ama–

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.650
The two of them...?!

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:08.830
Getting it on...?!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.970
There's no way that could happen!

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:12.370
Not to Seina-chan!

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.550
The two of them,

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:17.300
getting it on?!

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.110
Don't you think that was a little overdoing it?

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:20.510
Nah, that won't kill him...

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.760
Anyway, back to cleaning the bath!

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:23.920
Yes...

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:25.270
But...

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:26.930
Come on, hurry...

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:28.850
B-But first, can't you put some clothes on?

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:30.270
Just do what you're told!

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.570
Seina-chan...

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:39.490
is absolutely not...

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.490
getting it on with...

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:42.490
her!

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:54.880
Ki...

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:54.880
Yo.

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:58.800
They are getting it on!

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:01.840
Kiriko-san, i-it's not what it looks like!

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:04.850
These two really have it bad for each other!

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:05.850
Seina-chan!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.350
It's not what you think, Kiriko-san!

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:08.850
It's all a misunderstanding!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.060
Oh, is it now?

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.460
U-Um...

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:18.320
Dad!

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:33.070
So what did you come here for?

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:38.250
Your mother wouldn't stop saying
how badly she wanted to see you...

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:38.800
Liar.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:43.110
She said that she would bring
you back home for sure today.

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:44.300
No she didn't.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:49.700
First you go and leave the
Kaunaq house to join the GP,

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:51.560
and now I find you living in
a shabby house with a man!

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.600
Um, I'm...

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:54.730
So what's it to you?

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.470
It isn't what you think, sir.

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:59.680
Amane-san and Seina-kun have a
student-teacher relationship only...

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:02.820
Do all students and teachers take
baths and have massages together?

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.440
He's lying, right, Amane?!

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:06.030
He's lying, sir!

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:08.300
I have no desire to return to Kaunaq!

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.230
So leave!

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:10.250
You're still saying that?!

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:10.750
You keep saying the same things too!

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:18.000
You used to be such a beautiful,
well-behaved daughter...!

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:20.820
Would you like to see the old Amane?

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:21.510
O-Okay...

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.010
S-She's cute!

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:28.590
Hey, old man, it's no good to keep
thinking of her as a young girl.

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.010
She's not pure and innocent anymore–

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:31.020
Shut up!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.100
You're wasting my time!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:34.860
Seina, let's go do your training outside.

00:12:34.860 --> 00:12:35.730
R-Right.

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.270
Then I have no other choice.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:42.430
I'll check for myself to see if you are
truly training as teacher and student.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:43.840
Just leave!

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:44.710
Are you sure?

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.510
You're in for a big shock once you see what they do.

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:48.780
First, he takes Amane-san's hand and then–

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:51.290
Kiriko-sensei left early?!

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:54.540
Yeah. First Amane-sensei, now Kiriko-sensei...

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.750
Then they must be having some
serious three-way action!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:56.750
Good morning!

00:12:57.090 --> 00:13:01.740
All three of them together,
moaning and screaming!

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:58.900
Good morning...

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:07.140
Seina, Kiriko-sensei, and Amane-sensei,
getting it on in a threesome!

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:08.970
Getting it on... in a threesome...?

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.010
Just now, Elma-san's...

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:13.020
...gone.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:20.230
Come on, no resting yet!

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:22.100
It looks fun, doesn't it.

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:23.740
It's going to get even better.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.490
I wish he would just leave!

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.140
Don't you think if you sit down and talk to them

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:28.240
they might understand?

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:29.740
To hell with that.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:33.020
Amane-san's really attracted to that boy.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:34.440
This morning she was completely
naked except for an apron

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:36.520
and then she fed him with her mouth. And then...

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:39.420
Tell me, what kind of man is he?

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.910
Excellent question.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:44.550
The truth is,

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:48.300
he also has relationships
with Kiriko-san and Elma-san.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:50.940
What?! You mean he's cheating on Amane?!

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:52.310
That's not all.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.960
He did a great accomplishment while
still registering for the academy,

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:57.810
meaning he's really popular in the GP now.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.310
So he's an unforgivable type of man.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:03.890
But doesn't he seem like such a nice boy?

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:04.320
Hey now!

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:06.740
It's almost lunchtime.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.820
We shouldn't impose on them, dear.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.780
A threesome with Kiriko and Amane...

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:18.750
The three of them getting it on!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.000
I'll get rid of you, Seina!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:25.590
I will, I swear I will–

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:28.630
But wait until you hear this next part!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.840
Let me watch him and
Amane a little more first...

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:44.070
Seina!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:44.900
Seina-chan!

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:46.280
My word!

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:50.790
Sei...

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:51.990
Seina!

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:55.380
Outta the way!

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:55.380
Okay.

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:57.000
Seina, say something!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.750
Seina! Seina!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.460
Seina! Wake up, Seina!

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:03.460
Please! Seina!

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:09.010
A-Amane-sensei...

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.850
I'm so glad...

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.320
See you!

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.920
I hope you enjoyed your visit!

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.870
Come visit again!

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:42.900
What a nice father.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:44.080
Yes.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.340
Did you see that, dear?

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:56.440
Her face when she ran up to Seina?

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:59.940
She's become so feminine

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:01.440
without us realizing it.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:02.390
Yes.

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:12.570
But don't you think he's a bit young?

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:17.780
Say, why are you always facing the other way?

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:19.240
You mean I shouldn't?

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.840
No, it's okay with me,

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:23.540
but it just looks kind of strange.

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:26.790
Amane...

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:32.650
She used to be so adorable.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:38.260
You...

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:40.960
As long as she's happy,

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:43.140
isn't that all that matters?

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:53.610
And all the people you chose
for her were losers anyway.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.540
Amane!

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:03.010
Amane-sensei.

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:07.230
Are you sure it was okay not to see them off?

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.830
Sorry for everything today.

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:15.590
I acted so pathetically.

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:18.080
No, that's not true.

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:21.850
As a teacher, I mean.

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:23.850
But I feel relieved now!

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:30.320
I found out that regardless of how
advanced a civilization's science is,

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:34.030
everyone still laughs and
cries just like we do on Earth.

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:42.380
I don't really hate my old model job.

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:45.290
But as long as I'm a Kaunaq,

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:49.610
I'll never know how far my true skills go.

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:51.800
Amane-sensei...

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:55.050
So that's probably why I like working for the GP!

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:04.630
Amane-sensei, could you...

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:05.560
What's this?

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.060
Yamada Seina!

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:10.560
I challenge you to a–

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:14.650
Don't interrupt at a good time like this!

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:21.970
I forgot to ask because of
all that's been going on,

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:23.990
but what are you two doing
here at a time like this?!

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:27.750
I forgot to fix my lunch.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:30.250
I forgot my research materials.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.860
You guys kids or somethin'?!

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:32.930
What about you?!

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:35.890
Were you actually helping
Seina-chan with his training?!

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:37.020
Good question!

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:37.970
Of course I was.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:41.010
Seina's already about to pass
the first phase, after all.

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:42.820
Are you sure about that?

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:47.550
Would you like to see their day
of sweat, tears, and nosebleeds?

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:49.480
Okay! Please do...

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.650
Looks like you still don't have
a grasp on how strong you are.

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.540
I-I'll keep trying my best.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:04.170
I see...

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:06.040
Seina-kun, Seina-kun!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:06.990
Yes?

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:10.690
Oh, nothing...

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.870
Seina-kun!

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:17.980
Seina-kun~

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:19.850
Oh, nothing~

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:22.850
Oh, so good~

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:28.600
That's enough!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.590
Amane!

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:34.810
You need to get back to work! Okay?

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:37.340
I think I'll help you with his training instead!

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:38.860
I don't need your help!

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:39.860
I don't like the idea of only one trainer!

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:40.820
I'll stay here!

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:42.820
How lively.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.890
Didn't you guys leave?!

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:46.730
We simply went for lunch.

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:49.840
NB-kun said he had something
interesting to show us.

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:51.460
Perfect timing.

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:53.080
The good part's–

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:54.540
You're getting in the way of Seina's training!

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.590
Everyone out!

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:08.580
What another day today's been...

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:09.470
Seina-chan.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:14.480
You must be exhausted, Seina-chan.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.480
No, uh, I'm fine!

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:18.390
Don't be so reserved.

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:20.360
I'll scrub your back for you.

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:23.360
No, no! I'm really...

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:23.360
Seina-kun!

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.580
No, um, I'm already full...

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:31.580
Seina!

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.570
Seina-san,

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:36.800
As an apology for everything that
happened today I'll give you a massage.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.890
Seina!

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:09.400
Don't you guys need to change your clothes?

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:10.990
Is today a holiday or something?

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:12.740
Don't worry.

00:21:12.740 --> 00:21:16.040
We have permission
from Airi-sama and Mikami-sama.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:20.630
We've been ordered to
assist in your training too.

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:21.610
Right?

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:22.840
I never heard about this!

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:26.890
Are you serious?!

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:28.060
Yup.

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:32.390
Kiriko-sensei and Elma-san are
helping Amane-sensei with Seina now!

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.890
This very moment the four of them could be...

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:40.240
A Grand Cross between Seina,
Kiriko-sensei, Amane-sensei and Elma-san!

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:35.990
Morning...

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:41.900
A four-way with unbridled passion,
moaning, and sticky substances galore!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:44.850
The super erotic Grand Cross?!

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:46.910
Super erotic...?

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:49.120
Seiryo-sensei...

00:21:49.610 --> 00:21:51.330
Yup, he's gone.

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.370
Seina!

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:55.260
You won't get away with this!

00:21:55.260 --> 00:22:00.330
A four-way! Unbridled passion
and moaning! The Grand Cross!

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:03.400
You're as good as dead!

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:21.610
uchuu de saitei saiaku

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:21.610
You're the worst, most hopeless,

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:26.730
un warui Unlucky Boy

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:26.730
most unlucky boy in space.

00:22:32.270 --> 00:22:33.940
anna koto shite te mo

00:22:32.270 --> 00:22:33.940
No matter what you do,

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:36.670
konna koto shite te mo

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:36.670
no matter what you do,

00:22:36.940 --> 00:22:41.460
otozureru jiko tensai sugoi wana

00:22:36.940 --> 00:22:41.460
you can't escape the accidents, disasters and traps

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:43.750
anata wa nigerarenai

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:43.750
that come your way.

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:47.320
keikai shite te mo

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:47.320
Even if your really careful...

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:50.030
ikinari shichatte mo

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:50.030
And even if you're not...

00:22:50.290 --> 00:22:56.260
saitei saiaku dame dame no

00:22:50.290 --> 00:22:56.260
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:22:56.260 --> 00:23:00.730
anata wa doshiyou mo nai

00:22:56.260 --> 00:23:00.730
You're a lost cause.

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:10.680
anata ga saitei saiaku

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:10.680
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:15.300
anata wa Unlucky Boy

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:15.300
You're an unlucky boy.

00:23:15.300 --> 00:23:20.380
dakedo anata shika mienai

00:23:15.300 --> 00:23:20.380
But all I can see is you,

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:25.900
sonna anata shika mienai

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:25.900
just the way you are.

00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:34.350
I've finally been ordered for
a training voyage in space.

00:23:35.090 --> 00:23:36.120
My first on-the-job training.

00:23:36.120 --> 00:23:38.160
My first real curriculum.

00:23:38.160 --> 00:23:40.280
I sure hope it turns out
to be interesting training!

00:23:40.280 --> 00:23:44.270
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:45.610
A Hectic Space 
Training Voyage
